# Wave 13: compute event/displace (docs.lammps.org/compute_event_displace.html).
# A LJ liquid with deterministic velocities; the flag is printed every step. Measured with native LAMMPS
# (black box): the flag stayed 0 in every run tried, so the case checks that the
# engine keeps the same flag and the same thermo for the liquid.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all rel=1e-7 abs=1e-9
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 1.0
variable        vx atom 1.4*sin(1.7*x+2.3*y+0.7*z)
variable        vy atom 1.4*cos(2.1*x-1.1*y+0.3*z)
variable        vz atom 1.4*sin(0.5*x+1.9*z+1.3*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
velocity        all zero linear
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix 1 all nve
compute ev all event/displace 0.1
timestep 0.005
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo_style custom step temp pe c_ev
thermo 1
run 50
